[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "speaker": "A",
    "name": "Alex",
    "text": "A: Hey.",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 0.46,
    "duration": 0.46
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "speaker": "A",
    "name": "Alex",
    "text": "Guess what time I got up today.",
    "start": 0.46,
    "end": 2.51,
    "duration": 2.05
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "speaker": "A",
    "name": "Alex",
    "text": "Six thirty.",
    "start": 2.51,
    "end": 3.24,
    "duration": 0.73
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "speaker": "A",
    "name": "Alex",
    "text": "A.M.",
    "start": 3.24,
    "end": 3.5,
    "duration": 0.26
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "speaker": "A",
    "name": "Alex",
    "text": "B: Wait— six thirty?",
    "start": 3.5,
    "end": 5.12,
    "duration": 1.62
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "speaker": "A",
    "name": "Alex",
    "text": "You?",
    "start": 5.12,
    "end": 5.38,
    "duration": 0.26
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "speaker": "A",
    "name": "Alex",
    "text": "The guy who goes to bed at seven...",
    "start": 5.38,
    "end": 7.99,
    "duration": 2.61
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "speaker": "A",
    "name": "Alex",
    "text": "in the morning?",
    "start": 7.99,
    "end": 8.98,
    "duration": 0.99
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "speaker": "A",
    "name": "Alex",
    "text": "A: Hey, that was one time.",
    "start": 8.98,
    "end": 10.7,
    "duration": 1.72
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "speaker": "A",
    "name": "Alex",
    "text": "[chuckle] But yeah, I'm really trying to adjust my sleep schedule.",
    "start": 10.7,
    "end": 14.41,
    "duration": 3.71
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "speaker": "A",
    "name": "Alex",
    "text": "And honestly?",
    "start": 14.41,
    "end": 15.27,
    "duration": 0.86
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "speaker": "A",
    "name": "Alex",
    "text": "Waking up early makes me feel like my life is just...",
    "start": 15.27,
    "end": 19.07,
    "duration": 3.8
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "speaker": "A",
    "name": "Alex",
    "text": "full of possibilities.",
    "start": 19.07,
    "end": 20.53,
    "duration": 1.46
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "speaker": "A",
    "name": "Alex",
    "text": "B: No, I get that.",
    "start": 20.53,
    "end": 21.72,
    "duration": 1.19
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "speaker": "A",
    "name": "Alex",
    "text": "It's a great feeling.",
    "start": 21.72,
    "end": 23.11,
    "duration": 1.39
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "speaker": "A",
    "name": "Alex",
    "text": "Okay so— what else have you been thinking about?",
    "start": 23.11,
    "end": 26.58,
    "duration": 3.47
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "speaker": "A",
    "name": "Alex",
    "text": "A: Food, actually.",
    "start": 26.58,
    "end": 27.77,
    "duration": 1.19
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "speaker": "A",
    "name": "Alex",
    "text": "Like, a lot.",
    "start": 27.77,
    "end": 28.56,
    "duration": 0.79
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "speaker": "A",
    "name": "Alex",
    "text": "I want to eat low-calorie meals, but still make them delicious, you know?",
    "start": 28.56,
    "end": 33.39,
    "duration": 4.83
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "speaker": "A",
    "name": "Alex",
    "text": "B: Okay, so give me an example.",
    "start": 33.39,
    "end": 35.44,
    "duration": 2.05
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "speaker": "A",
    "name": "Alex",
    "text": "What's a meal you like?",
    "start": 35.44,
    "end": 36.96,
    "duration": 1.52
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "speaker": "A",
    "name": "Alex",
    "text": "A: Alright, so— brown rice, chicken, veggies...",
    "start": 36.96,
    "end": 40.37,
    "duration": 3.41
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "speaker": "A",
    "name": "Alex",
    "text": "and a little sesame sauce on top.",
    "start": 40.37,
    "end": 42.55,
    "duration": 2.18
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "speaker": "A",
    "name": "Alex",
    "text": "B: Ooh, that's a solid combo.",
    "start": 42.55,
    "end": 44.47,
    "duration": 1.92
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "speaker": "A",
    "name": "Alex",
    "text": "Because brown rice is a whole grain, chicken breast is low in fat, high in protein...",
    "start": 44.47,
    "end": 50.39,
    "duration": 5.92
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "speaker": "A",
    "name": "Alex",
    "text": "that's a great base, right there.",
    "start": 50.39,
    "end": 52.57,
    "duration": 2.18
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "speaker": "A",
    "name": "Alex",
    "text": "A: Right?",
    "start": 52.57,
    "end": 53.17,
    "duration": 0.6
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "speaker": "A",
    "name": "Alex",
    "text": "And don't forget the mushrooms.",
    "start": 53.17,
    "end": 55.22,
    "duration": 2.05
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "speaker": "A",
    "name": "Alex",
    "text": "Dietary fiber, baby.",
    "start": 55.22,
    "end": 56.54,
    "duration": 1.32
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "speaker": "A",
    "name": "Alex",
    "text": "B: [chuckle] Exactly.",
    "start": 56.54,
    "end": 57.33,
    "duration": 0.79
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "speaker": "A",
    "name": "Alex",
    "text": "And if you throw in broccoli and carrots— low in calories, high in fiber and vitamins.",
    "start": 57.33,
    "end": 63.32,
    "duration": 5.99
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "speaker": "A",
    "name": "Alex",
    "text": "You're basically set.",
    "start": 63.32,
    "end": 64.71,
    "duration": 1.39
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "speaker": "A",
    "name": "Alex",
    "text": "A: Okay, but what about the sesame sauce, though?",
    "start": 64.71,
    "end": 67.95,
    "duration": 3.24
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "speaker": "A",
    "name": "Alex",
    "text": "Is that actually healthy?",
    "start": 67.95,
    "end": 69.6,
    "duration": 1.65
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "speaker": "A",
    "name": "Alex",
    "text": "Be honest.",
    "start": 69.6,
    "end": 70.26,
    "duration": 0.66
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "speaker": "A",
    "name": "Alex",
    "text": "B: Well...",
    "start": 70.26,
    "end": 71.22,
    "duration": 0.96
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "speaker": "A",
    "name": "Alex",
    "text": "it has some healthy fats, but it's also really calorie-dense.",
    "start": 71.22,
    "end": 75.26,
    "duration": 4.04
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "speaker": "A",
    "name": "Alex",
    "text": "A: So just a little then?",
    "start": 75.26,
    "end": 76.91,
    "duration": 1.65
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "speaker": "A",
    "name": "Alex",
    "text": "B: Just a little.",
    "start": 76.91,
    "end": 78.03,
    "duration": 1.12
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "speaker": "A",
    "name": "Alex",
    "text": "A little sesame sauce for flavor, since it's so high in calories.",
    "start": 78.03,
    "end": 82.33,
    "duration": 4.3
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "speaker": "A",
    "name": "Alex",
    "text": "A: Got it, got it.",
    "start": 82.33,
    "end": 83.52,
    "duration": 1.19
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "speaker": "A",
    "name": "Alex",
    "text": "So basically— if I want food that's low calorie but still tasty, I just use spices.",
    "start": 83.52,
    "end": 89.31,
    "duration": 5.79
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "speaker": "A",
    "name": "Alex",
    "text": "B: Yes.",
    "start": 89.31,
    "end": 89.77,
    "duration": 0.46
  },
  {
    "id": 43,
    "speaker": "A",
    "name": "Alex",
    "text": "Spices, herbs, vinegar, lemon juice...",
    "start": 89.77,
    "end": 92.58,
    "duration": 2.81
  },
  {
    "id": 44,
    "speaker": "A",
    "name": "Alex",
    "text": "small amounts of strong sauces.",
    "start": 92.58,
    "end": 94.63,
    "duration": 2.05
  },
  {
    "id": 45,
    "speaker": "A",
    "name": "Alex",
    "text": "That's the whole trick.",
    "start": 94.63,
    "end": 96.15,
    "duration": 1.52
  },
  {
    "id": 46,
    "speaker": "A",
    "name": "Alex",
    "text": "A: Okay, so I can say: I use spices, and just a little sauce, to add flavor without too many calories.",
    "start": 96.15,
    "end": 102.9,
    "duration": 6.75
  },
  {
    "id": 47,
    "speaker": "A",
    "name": "Alex",
    "text": "B: Perfectly said.",
    "start": 102.9,
    "end": 104.09,
    "duration": 1.19
  },
  {
    "id": 48,
    "speaker": "A",
    "name": "Alex",
    "text": "Nailed it.",
    "start": 104.09,
    "end": 104.75,
    "duration": 0.66
  },
  {
    "id": 49,
    "speaker": "A",
    "name": "Alex",
    "text": "A: Ha!",
    "start": 104.75,
    "end": 105.15,
    "duration": 0.4
  },
  {
    "id": 50,
    "speaker": "A",
    "name": "Alex",
    "text": "Nice.",
    "start": 105.15,
    "end": 105.48,
    "duration": 0.33
  },
  {
    "id": 51,
    "speaker": "A",
    "name": "Alex",
    "text": "That's what I want to practice saying.",
    "start": 105.48,
    "end": 108.04,
    "duration": 2.56
  }
]